    "intro_narrative": "The year is 2142. It has been decades since the Great Ash War scorched the earth, leaving only isolated bunkers and irradiated wastelands in its wake. You are a scavenger navigating the ruins of Outpost Omega, a legendary pre-war research facility rumored to hold the last uncorrupted seed bank in existence—a literal seed of hope for humanity. The heavy steel doors have sealed shut behind you, and the air filtration system is failing. To access the innermost sanctum and secure the Vault Core, you must interface with a series of archaic terminals and survival gear left behind by the facility's last inhabitants. Piece together the scattered data fragments and power up the forgotten tech before the toxic dust storms breach the outpost.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
  },
